Package: jaspPropensityScoreMethods
Type: Package
Title: Propensity Score Methods for JASP
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-11-15
Author: egonzato
URL: https://github.com/egonzato/jaspPropensityScoreMethods
BugReports: https://github.com/egonzato/jaspPropensityScoreMethods/issues
Maintainer: egonzato <139107666+egonzato@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Causal inference with propensity score methods in JASP: propensity score matching
  (nearest neighbour or optimal, on the propensity score, its logit or the Mahalanobis distance)
  and inverse probability of treatment weighting, with covariate balance diagnostics.
